      "expression": "measured",
      "outfit": "north_slope_steward",
      "text": "末法之下，集中资源才能保住足够强的下一代。药柜、修院和外城保费都有条件，条件写在纸上，并不因为今天有人受伤就自动消失。",
      "next": "sjj_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "sjj_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "sjj_choice_publish_terms",
          "text": "把测针记录、捐助附件、药柜钥匙和撤资后果逐项公开，让每个孩子与监护人知道自己在选择什么。",
          "next": "sjj_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "shentu_jingjian", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "shentu_jingjian_terms_public", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "sjj_choice_aid_first",
          "text": "先打开捐赠柜救急，再把资源损失、撤资风险和旧案责任分开记账，不能让孩子先付代价。",
          "next": "sjj_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "shentu_jingjian", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "shentu_jingjian_aid_first_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sjj_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "protagonist",
      "expression": "firm",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "条件可以有，不能把没有听懂的孩子、失联的人和已经受损的人一起算成同一种同意。药要先救急，责任再按谁授权、谁得利、谁早该看出不对逐项追问。",
